# Backend Conventions

## server.js

- Prepared statements in `stmts` object — add new queries there
- `SLOTS` array is generated (09:00–17:30); validate against it
- `ensureToday()` clears stale dates; do not reintroduce in-memory-only store
- SSE: `clients` array, `broadcast()` sends full `loadSlots()` JSON
- Custom SSE events: `clear` (daily reset)
- Rate limit on `/api/toggle` only (30 req/min)
- Helmet CSP allows `'unsafe-inline'` for scripts/styles — required for inline frontend

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `PORT` | `8080` | Listen port |
| `DB_PATH` | `data/pingpong.db` | SQLite file path |
| `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` | unset | Optional Slack notifications |
| `DASHBOARD_URL` | openshift route | Dashboard link in Slack messages |
| `OFFICE_TZ` | `America/New_York` | Slot past-check and daily date |

## OpenShift

- `Recreate` deployment strategy (PVC is RWO)
- `app.set('trust proxy', 1)` — required behind ingress for rate limiter
- Toggle logs: `toggle <name> <slot> add|remove` — use `oc logs` to debug Slack
- Do not increase replicas without changing storage architecture
- CronJob calls `POST /api/clear` for daily reset
